    {
      "name": "暴风影音缓存",
      "group": "cache",
      "kind": "dir",
      "safe": "安全",
      "desc": "清理暴风影音的网页组件缓存（播放记录、登录状态不动）",
      "cat": "视频播放",
      "dprobe": "Baofeng",
      "paths": [
        "$env:APPDATA\\baofeng\\cefcache",
        "C:\\Users\\*\\AppData\\Roaming\\baofeng\\cefcache",
        "D:\\Users\\*\\AppData\\Roaming\\baofeng\\cefcache",
        "$env:LOCALAPPDATA\\baofeng\\cefcache",
        "C:\\Users\\*\\AppData\\Local\\baofeng\\cefcache",
        "D:\\Users\\*\\AppData\\Local\\baofeng\\cefcache"
      ],
      "note": "来源：2026-11-15 本机实测（暴风影音5 5.92.0824.1111）。真实缓存目录是 %APPDATA%\\baofeng\\cefcache，13.21MB/56 文件。原内置条目写 BaoFeng\\Cache/logs/temp 与 Storm\\Cache，实测一个都不存在（命中 0 项），已删改云端"
    },
    {
